{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55322","headline":"赠金励睡诗 二 · 陈抟","name":"赠金励睡诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至人本无梦，其梦本游仙。\n真人本无睡，睡则浮云烟。\n炉里近（《事今类聚》作「名」）爲药，壶中别有天。\n欲知睡梦里，人间第一玄。\n（《增修诗话总龟》卷四六引《翰府名谈》、《事文类聚後集》卷二一。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈抟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}